[ti:35. Our Village]
[by:Generated by iChochy]

[00:01.071]Lesson 35. | 第35课。
[00:04.141]This is a photograph /ˈfəʊtəɡrɑːf/ of our village /ˈvɪlɪdʒ/. | 这是我们村庄的照片。
[00:08.011]Our village /ˈvɪlɪdʒ/ is in a valley /ˈvæli/. | 我们的村庄在一个山谷里。
[00:10.741]It is between two hills /hɪlz/. | 它在两座山之间。
[00:14.071]The village /ˈvɪlɪdʒ/ is on a river. | 村庄在一条河边。
[00:18.421]Here is another /əˈnʌðə/ photograph /ˈfəʊtəɡrɑːf/ of the village /ˈvɪlɪdʒ/. | 这是村庄的另一张照片。
[00:22.561]My wife /waɪf/ and I are walking along the banks /bæŋks/ of the river. | 我妻子和我在河岸边散步。
[00:28.021]We are on the left. | 我们在左边。
[00:31.431]There is a boy in the water /ˈwɔːtə/. | 水里有一个男孩。
[00:34.251]He is swimming /ˈswɪmɪŋ/ across the river. | 他正在横渡这条河。
[00:38.641]Here is another /əˈnʌðə/ photograph /ˈfəʊtəɡrɑːf/. | 这是另一张照片。
[00:42.341]This is the school building /ˈbɪldɪŋ/. | 这是教学楼。
[00:45.391]It is beside a park /pɑːk/. | 它在一个公园旁边。
[00:48.011]The park /pɑːk/ is on the right. | 公园在右边。
[00:51.351]Some children are coming out of the building /ˈbɪldɪŋ/. | 一些孩子正从楼里出来。
[00:54.671]Some of them are going into the park /pɑːk/. | 他们中的一些人正走进公园。